  "notes": [
    "Play-In: two groups of four, double round robin, Bo1; group winners face the two invited teams in Bo5s (round 2); round 2 winners join the group stage and the losers play a final Bo5 (round 3) for the last spot. Group stage: six teams, double round robin, Bo1; the top four advance. Ties spanning 1st/2nd or 4th/5th are played off with Bo1 games, without head-to-head first: at MSI 2017 G2 took 3rd from a three-way tie and only FW and TSM played for 4th, although head-to-head ranked TSM above FW. Knockout: Bo5 semifinals (1st vs 4th, 2nd vs 3rd) and final.",
    "Leaguepedia places this play-in's eliminated teams by wins rather than group position, so the ruleset does the same.",
    "Formats, series lengths, tiebreaker games and placements are verified by replaying the recorded results.",
    "Not modelled: the play-in draw rules (seeds, region separation). Forward simulations draw these randomly."
  ],
